[post_office_conundrum]: proof of concept
cube - services the package - "who has the answer" - 04 - 10 - Service/Question
fold - contains the package - "i hold the answer" - 10 - 04 - Answer/Acknowledge
file - stores the package - "the answer is this" - 09 - 01 - Call/Please
wire - moves the package - "tell me the answer" - 02 - 11 - Respond/Reply
post - sorts the package - "the answer is complex" - 12 - 02 - Emergency/Accident
tape - logs the package - "answer is complex noted" - 06 - 06 - Detected/Sighted
belt - stages the package - "there is the answer" - 11 - 12 - Start/Finish
lens - seeks the package - "where is the answer - 03 - 05 - Search/Query
deck - carries the package - "i have the answer" - 01 - 03 - Suspect/Target
edge - stamps the package - "i approve the answer" - 07 - 08 - Solve/Mystery
hole - drops the package - "i forgot the answer" - 08 - 09 - Something/Dark
rift - unwraps the package - "i remember the answer" - 05 - 07 - Soon/Side
"what was the answer" - this is the packaging center's logistics department chipset on a daily basis

[superintendent_vergil's_sentinel_carilien]: the engineer's support call
hut is derelict and abandoned - sentinel building is derlict and abandoned
cue turns on the lights - toggle switch turns on the lights
cam sees the lights turn on - surveillance camera sees the lights turn on
cop enters the building - detective inspector enters the building
bud senses something off - reflex instinct senses something off
mix is sending mixed signals - inner sanctum is sending mixed signals
rim rings with some feedback - radio signal rings with some feedback
way tightens in distress - cribbs causeway tightens in distress
pit shuts down and panics - chamber lock shuts down and panics
cab opens and shuts the case - bureau secretary opens and shuts the case
arm writes some written notes - personal assistant writes some written notes
leg ran away from the scene a long time ago - field crew ran away from the scene a long time ago
"there was no one there" - all of the crew were robot ghosts with neural implants to enhance their persona

